WEBVTT

00:00:05.560 --> 00:00:09.930
"'The long hair hanging over my face...

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:23.580
Just by your being there,

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:30.250
the world seems to sparkle.

00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:33.920
At one point,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:39.050
l had given up on love.

00:00:40.260 --> 00:00:46.930
Just for you, God must have...

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:53.270
...done a custom-made job.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:56.940
This body of mine...

00:00:56.940 --> 00:01:03.880
...is ascending to Heaven
along with carbonated bubbles.

00:01:03.880 --> 00:01:04.880
Wait!

00:01:04.880 --> 00:01:11.560
Baby, baby, my low tension baby,

00:01:11.560 --> 00:01:15.230
Come chasing after me...

00:01:15.230 --> 00:01:18.230
more and more!

00:01:18.230 --> 00:01:24.570
ln heavy, heavy rotation, baby,

00:01:24.570 --> 00:01:28.570
l'm totally...

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:33.440
...crazy about you!

00:01:46.590 --> 00:01:47.930
W- what?!

00:01:47.930 --> 00:01:49.590
Sae-chan, you planned this, didn't you?

00:01:49.590 --> 00:01:50.930
What are you talking about?

00:01:50.930 --> 00:01:54.590
This is so awful!
I thought you were my friend.

00:01:57.270 --> 00:01:58.600
Adachi...

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:01.210
It's all over between us.

00:02:01.210 --> 00:02:02.870
No, it isn't!

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:05.000
But I'm not a...

00:02:09.210 --> 00:02:11.550
That Sae-chan!

00:02:11.550 --> 00:02:12.570
Time for revenge!

00:02:13.220 --> 00:02:18.360
"'Peach Crisis"'

00:02:18.360 --> 00:02:26.330
"'Be sure to sit away from the TV
in a well-lit room when watching anime"'

00:02:26.330 --> 00:02:28.300
Yep! My older brother's friend is a director,

00:02:28.300 --> 00:02:31.970
and he asked me if I knew a cute,
lovely high school girl.

00:02:31.970 --> 00:02:34.310
Immediately I thought of you, Sae-chan!

00:02:34.310 --> 00:02:36.310
But why me?

00:02:36.310 --> 00:02:40.310
He's been really good to me,
and I would like to return the favor.

00:02:40.310 --> 00:02:42.980
Sae-chan, you're exactly
the type he's looking for.

00:02:42.980 --> 00:02:46.990
He said, "'a girl pure as a daisy,
someone you want to protect."'

00:02:46.990 --> 00:02:49.650
And who else matches
that description, Sae-chan?

00:02:49.650 --> 00:02:53.320
True! Well, I guess I could go talk to him.

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:55.990
But if I don't like the part,
I'm turning him down!

00:02:55.990 --> 00:02:57.930
Thank you!

00:03:04.270 --> 00:03:05.940
What's with this? There's no one here.

00:03:05.940 --> 00:03:08.270
Strange...

00:03:08.270 --> 00:03:11.270
My cell won't work in here,
so I'm going outside to call him.

00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:19.950
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:03:19.950 --> 00:03:21.290
Are you the director?

00:03:21.290 --> 00:03:24.620
Okay! Shall we start
from the castigation scene?

00:03:29.960 --> 00:03:30.960
W- what?!

00:03:30.960 --> 00:03:34.860
"'The Fly Man Strikes Back!!"'
Scene 15! Start!

00:03:39.640 --> 00:03:42.970
Okayasu is very late. And he was
the one who asked to meet us.

00:03:43.980 --> 00:03:46.640
Are you okay... physically?

00:03:46.640 --> 00:03:47.310
Mm-hmm.

00:03:47.310 --> 00:03:52.650
The reason why I kissed Kashiwagi is
because I thought she was you, Adachi.

00:03:52.650 --> 00:03:58.320
She had on a wig and had put on
the same perfume I had given you.

00:03:58.320 --> 00:04:00.260
Oh, is that why?

00:04:00.260 --> 00:04:05.260
You're so awful, Sae! You deceived
not only me, but Toji as well!

00:04:05.260 --> 00:04:07.600
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:04:07.600 --> 00:04:09.930
What's with you two?
You look awfully morose.

00:04:09.930 --> 00:04:11.600
You're just too jovial.

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:17.280
Well, cheer up, both of you.
I got revenge on Sae-chan for us.

00:04:17.280 --> 00:04:18.280
What do you mean?

00:04:18.280 --> 00:04:23.370
I thought I'd give Sae-chan a taste
of what you went through, Momo-chan.

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:27.620
Stay away, you idiot!

00:04:27.620 --> 00:04:30.290
Don't come near me!
You blimp! You pork-pie!

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:32.990
My! What a foul-mouthed
little pussycat she is!

00:04:32.990 --> 00:04:36.630
She definitely needs some disciplining!

00:04:36.630 --> 00:04:38.300
Come here, you pussycat!

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:41.750
Wait up! Wait up, I say!

00:04:44.640 --> 00:04:46.970
So, right now Sae is?

00:04:46.970 --> 00:04:50.980
Well, she's just gonna get a little scare,
that's all. She asked for it.

00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:51.640
But...

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:54.650
What else is there? She keeps doing
horrid things to you, Momo-chan.

00:04:54.650 --> 00:04:57.320
Compared to how she's hurt you,
Momo-chan, this is nothing.

00:04:57.320 --> 00:04:59.980
Are you sure she's just
going to get a scare

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:02.920
and this man isn't
really going to attack her?

00:05:02.920 --> 00:05:04.160
Well, who knows?

00:05:04.160 --> 00:05:08.680
He is a man, and when a man gets alone
with a cute girl like her...

00:05:12.260 --> 00:05:13.260
Momo-chan?

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:14.990
I'm going.

00:05:16.270 --> 00:05:18.940
I'm going to get Sae.

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:22.940
What for? Momo-chan, you're the one
who has reason to hate Sae-chan the most!

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:25.040
But... I know how it feels.

00:05:25.040 --> 00:05:28.270
I know how it scares a girl to go
through something like that.

00:05:32.280 --> 00:05:32.950
Momo-chan...

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:35.620
Adachi, I'm going with you!

00:05:35.620 --> 00:05:36.950
Wait up, you two!

00:05:41.630 --> 00:05:43.960
l hope Sae's all right...

00:05:45.960 --> 00:05:48.300
No! Leave me alone!
Take your hands off me!

00:05:48.300 --> 00:05:52.830
You really are a cute little thing!
I might end up seriously going for you.

00:05:54.640 --> 00:05:56.640
It sounds like she really is being attacked!

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:58.310
Sae!

00:05:58.310 --> 00:06:00.580
Sae! Are you in there, Sae?!

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:04.920
Momo-chan? Help me!
Help me! Please! Hurry!

00:06:04.920 --> 00:06:08.920
Open this door! If you don't
open this door, we'll call the police!

00:06:08.920 --> 00:06:10.890
Mreow!

00:06:12.590 --> 00:06:14.260
What's that?! What's going on in there!?

00:06:14.260 --> 00:06:15.380
Kashiwagi!

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:18.260
Move!

00:06:25.270 --> 00:06:33.630
W- what?

00:06:37.280 --> 00:06:40.380
I could use a kick like that...

00:06:48.960 --> 00:06:50.960
It looks like she's all right.

00:06:50.960 --> 00:06:53.970
Now do you know how Adachi felt?!

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:57.600
Now you've physically
experienced how horrid,

00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:58.970
how cowardly what you did to Adachi was...

00:06:58.970 --> 00:07:02.240
You... you were all in on this?!

00:07:02.240 --> 00:07:05.510
No! Momo-chan and Toji
knew nothing about this!

00:07:10.920 --> 00:07:12.920
Kashiwagi!

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:15.920
This is too much! This is
much worse than what I did!

00:07:15.920 --> 00:07:18.920
Nothing happened to Momo-chan
with Jigoro that night!

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:23.260
What if something had really happened
to me?! Would you be responsible for it?!

00:07:23.260 --> 00:07:25.630
I should be asking you the same thing.

00:07:25.630 --> 00:07:29.930
Sae, I'll never forgive you
for the things you've done to me.

00:07:29.930 --> 00:07:34.270
I've spent a long time
thinking about what to say to you,

00:07:34.270 --> 00:07:37.500
how to convince you to stop this
sort of thing, but now I get it.

00:07:39.940 --> 00:07:42.610
Anything I say to you is a waste of breath.

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:45.920
So, I'm done with you.

00:07:45.920 --> 00:07:48.620
I'm cutting all contact with you
from this moment forward.

00:07:48.620 --> 00:07:50.050
Bye-bye, Sae.

00:07:57.960 --> 00:08:00.230
Learned your lesson?

00:08:00.230 --> 00:08:03.900
Well, I can't say that I don't
understand how you feel, Sae-chan.

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:09.910
Momo-chan's face when she's with Toji
is so happy-looking. I'm really envious.

00:08:09.910 --> 00:08:11.240
Come off it!

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:13.910
Sae-chan, you want to be like that,

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:16.080
and you think if you're dating Toji,
you can be that way.

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:17.580
Isn't that what you're thinking?

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:20.450
But I'll tell you, even if you
got to sit in Momo-chan's place

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:22.590
by using some vicious means,
you'd never be happy like that.

00:08:22.590 --> 00:08:26.260
What makes you think
I'm inferior to Momo-chan?!

00:08:26.260 --> 00:08:29.260
The happiness between
Momo-chan and Toji...

00:08:29.260 --> 00:08:31.930
...is due to the fact that they've
overcome a lot of stuff together.

00:08:31.930 --> 00:08:36.600
They've worked hard on their relationship.

00:08:36.600 --> 00:08:39.600
So, if you try to take him away from her,
Sae-chan, you'll never do it.

00:08:39.600 --> 00:08:40.700
Well, see ya...

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:48.440
How dare they!
Always putting others down!

00:08:52.950 --> 00:08:55.920
Whatever I can't get
my hands on, I'll break!

00:09:00.890 --> 00:09:03.900
Nothing happened between me and Jigoro...

00:09:03.900 --> 00:09:05.450
Thank goodness!

00:09:07.900 --> 00:09:10.300
Now l am finally free of Sae...

00:09:11.570 --> 00:09:13.000
Finally...

00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:20.910
This Sunday?

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:23.510
We only got a start on
celebrating your birthday, Adachi.

00:09:23.510 --> 00:09:25.250
Want to go to an amusement park?

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:27.110
An amusement park!

00:09:29.920 --> 00:09:31.550
Well, well!

00:09:38.600 --> 00:09:40.600
So, what time should we meet?

00:09:40.600 --> 00:09:43.230
I think the earlier the better.
It's less crowded that way...

00:09:48.940 --> 00:09:51.610
Toji?

00:09:51.610 --> 00:09:54.910
I need to talk to you about Momo-chan.
Can you come here a minute?

00:09:56.280 --> 00:09:57.950
What did you want?

00:09:57.950 --> 00:10:00.320
Break up with Momo-chan.

00:10:03.620 --> 00:10:04.620
No way.

00:10:04.620 --> 00:10:09.390
You think that's a good idea, to speak
that way? What do you think this is?

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:16.970
Tomorrow they're having
a big press conference

00:10:16.970 --> 00:10:17.970
about the new drama Jigoro is in.

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:19.740
If you don't break up with Momo-chan,

00:10:19.740 --> 00:10:21.800
I'm going to spread this photo
all over that press conference.

00:10:23.980 --> 00:10:26.640
I'm not letting you do that!

00:10:26.640 --> 00:10:28.980
How did you get this photo?
When did you?

00:10:28.980 --> 00:10:31.320
Too bad!

00:10:31.320 --> 00:10:34.320
I have all these copies...

00:10:34.320 --> 00:10:35.990
Well, what are you gonna do?

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:39.990
Jigoro's a model, so a
little scandal won't hurt him,

00:10:39.990 --> 00:10:44.660
and it'll generate publicity for the
new drama, so the network will be thrilled.

00:10:44.660 --> 00:10:50.330
But how's Momo going to feel?
You know the media will eat her alive.

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:52.070
And whether it's true or not,

00:10:52.070 --> 00:10:55.340
don't you think that it'll be
a huge scar on her future?

00:10:55.340 --> 00:10:58.340
They might even throw her out of school.

00:10:58.340 --> 00:10:59.540
Out of school?

00:11:02.610 --> 00:11:07.620
I was too kind to you. I had no idea
how rotten you were inside, Kashiwagi.

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:10.320
You think it's a good idea
to talk to me that way?

00:11:10.320 --> 00:11:12.960
Get this through your head:
I'll really do it.

00:11:12.960 --> 00:11:14.930
Over my dead body!

00:11:16.630 --> 00:11:20.090
No matter what, I'm going
to protect Adachi!

00:11:36.650 --> 00:11:38.270
Toji!!

00:11:41.320 --> 00:11:44.320
I was so excited,
I made too much for lunch!

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:45.320
Shall we go?

00:11:45.320 --> 00:11:46.310
Mm-hmm!

00:11:48.990 --> 00:11:51.390
l'm gonna have so much fun!

00:12:24.630 --> 00:12:26.300
Isn't it any good?

00:12:26.300 --> 00:12:28.970
Uh... No! It's delicious!

00:12:28.970 --> 00:12:32.970
What's wrong? You've been
acting like you're on another world...

00:12:32.970 --> 00:12:37.640
That's not so... By the way,
what time is it?

00:12:37.640 --> 00:12:39.310
A little before 1:00.

00:12:39.310 --> 00:12:43.770
The press conference starts at 5:00.
lf you change your mind, call me.

00:12:47.990 --> 00:12:48.650
Yes?

00:12:48.650 --> 00:12:51.320
Momo-chan? Having fun on your date?

00:12:51.320 --> 00:12:52.790
Sae?!

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:56.260
Sae wants to speak to you.

00:12:57.330 --> 00:12:58.000
Hello?

00:12:58.000 --> 00:12:59.360
You look like you're enjoying yourself.

00:12:59.360 --> 00:13:01.600
But the time limit is up
in a little more than four hours.

00:13:01.600 --> 00:13:04.330
I guess you better have lots
of fun on this, your last date.

00:13:10.610 --> 00:13:12.610
Kashiwagi!

00:13:12.610 --> 00:13:14.950
Toji! Wait! Where are you going?!

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:17.110
Wait! Kashiwagi!

00:13:25.620 --> 00:13:27.250
Toji!!

00:13:29.290 --> 00:13:31.060
What's wrong?

00:13:32.630 --> 00:13:35.300
Ah... nothing.

00:13:35.300 --> 00:13:38.640
But something's weird here!
Why is Sae here?

00:13:38.640 --> 00:13:40.970
Why is she phoning you, Toji?!

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:46.640
If Sae's said something to you again,
please talk it over with me!

00:13:46.640 --> 00:13:50.980
Break up with Momo-chan. lf you don't,
l'm going to spread this photo all over...

00:13:50.980 --> 00:13:55.650
No, It's nothing.
She just said something ugly.

00:13:55.650 --> 00:13:57.750
Well, if that's all, then fine...

00:14:01.930 --> 00:14:04.260
Shall we go?

00:14:04.260 --> 00:14:06.090
It's getting dark.

00:14:07.260 --> 00:14:08.930
Mm-hmm.

00:14:08.930 --> 00:14:12.940
What's wrong with Toji?
He looks so scared.

00:14:12.940 --> 00:14:17.270
And here l wanted so much
to have a good time today...

00:14:17.270 --> 00:14:21.710
The press conference starts at 5:00.
lf you change your mind, call me.

00:14:25.280 --> 00:14:28.950
"'Special TV Drama!
'I Love But Am Not Loved'"'

00:14:28.950 --> 00:14:32.620
"'Original Story: Ueda Miwa
Screenplay: Nishimori Chiemi

00:14:39.300 --> 00:14:42.660
You there! This isn't open to the public...

00:14:44.970 --> 00:14:48.310
She... she just... she just disappeared!

00:14:48.310 --> 00:14:53.170
l can still find Kashiwagi and stop her.
l have to find the press conference site.

00:14:55.980 --> 00:14:56.980
What's wrong?

00:14:56.980 --> 00:15:00.470
There! As our last ride, let's do that!

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:03.920
But it's crowded.

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:06.260
Let's come back some other time.
Today is...

00:15:06.260 --> 00:15:08.930
Can't we stay a little longer?

00:15:08.930 --> 00:15:12.160
Today was supposed to be
my birthday celebration...

00:15:15.600 --> 00:15:20.040
We'd like to begin our press announcement
of the new TV drama special

00:15:20.040 --> 00:15:21.470
"'I Love But Am Not Loved."'

00:15:21.470 --> 00:15:23.400
"'No new messages"'

00:15:33.280 --> 00:15:35.620
He's not saying a word to me...

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:39.320
Please say something... lf you don't,
it makes me so nervous.

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:45.300
Next, let me introduce
a young man new to television

00:15:45.300 --> 00:15:46.300
and yet chosen for the supporting role:

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:47.630
Oji Goro-san.

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:50.300
He will tell you about
his preparation for this role.

00:15:50.300 --> 00:15:54.140
I'd like to introduce myself.
My name is Oji.

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:04.070
I'm afraid we'll have to
cancel the press conference!

00:16:06.920 --> 00:16:08.920
Yes?

00:16:08.920 --> 00:16:10.480
Hello?

00:16:25.600 --> 00:16:26.940
Look, Toji!

00:16:26.940 --> 00:16:28.960
The sunset is so beautiful!

00:16:35.610 --> 00:16:37.480
Toji?

00:16:39.950 --> 00:16:41.510
Let's break it off.

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:53.300
What? So suddenly? What happened, Toji?

00:16:53.300 --> 00:16:55.200
Why would you say that?

00:16:56.970 --> 00:16:58.300
No reason...

00:16:58.300 --> 00:17:00.530
I'm just suddenly sick of the whole thing.

00:17:02.240 --> 00:17:03.900
I'm sorry.

00:17:09.910 --> 00:17:12.220
"'Drive safely"'

00:17:12.220 --> 00:17:12.920
You're so slow!

00:17:12.920 --> 00:17:15.250
You promised to give me the photos.

00:17:15.250 --> 00:17:17.490
If your call had been one minute later,

00:17:17.490 --> 00:17:20.050
I would already have
given the media those photos.

00:17:28.930 --> 00:17:30.600
Now erase it from your phone.

00:17:30.600 --> 00:17:33.500
If you do it yourself,
you'll be sure it was done.

00:17:35.140 --> 00:17:36.610
"'Delete All
Delete One"'

00:17:36.610 --> 00:17:38.110
"'Do you want to delete this?
Yes No"'

00:17:38.110 --> 00:17:39.270
"'Data Deleted"'

00:17:41.610 --> 00:17:45.620
Well! This is our first date!
Shall we start with dinner?

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:48.290
Forget it.

00:17:48.290 --> 00:17:50.950
Who said I was going to go
with you, Kashiwagi?

00:17:50.950 --> 00:17:56.960
If you insist, then fine, but I'll break up
with you one second after we start.

00:17:56.960 --> 00:18:01.900
You think you can stand the disgrace
of being dumped, Kashiwagi?

00:18:01.900 --> 00:18:04.570
Ha! I figured you'd do this.

00:18:04.570 --> 00:18:07.200
Your little scheme is pretty easy to see.

00:18:07.200 --> 00:18:10.240
You do everything I want
until the data is deleted,

00:18:10.240 --> 00:18:13.910
and then, when things have cooled off,
you go back to dating Momo-chan again.

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:18.250
You're so stupid! Did you think I
wouldn't have a trump card in reserve?

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:19.580
Don't tell me!

00:18:19.580 --> 00:18:24.920
I've still got the photo! I put it
on a disk and I have it at home!

00:18:24.920 --> 00:18:25.920
Why, you little!

00:18:25.920 --> 00:18:30.950
What are you doing with your hands?
Do you think it's wise to treat me like this?

00:18:34.600 --> 00:18:39.270
Don't worry! Eventually, I'll give it
to you... when I'm done with you.

00:18:39.270 --> 00:18:40.240
Okay?

00:18:42.610 --> 00:18:45.610
Let's break it off. l'm just
suddenly sick of the whole thing.

00:18:45.610 --> 00:18:48.950
That can't be right. Toji couldn't
really seriously say that...

00:18:48.950 --> 00:18:53.140
You are being transferred
to a Voice Mail Box.

00:18:55.620 --> 00:19:00.560
This is Momo. I've been calling
since yesterday. Why won't you answer?

00:19:00.560 --> 00:19:06.230
Why did you suddenly say that?
Something is strange, Toji. What's wrong?

00:19:06.230 --> 00:19:08.230
Anyway, I want to talk to you.

00:19:08.230 --> 00:19:11.570
Please meet me before class on the bench
in the school's back courtyard.

00:19:11.570 --> 00:19:13.430
Oh, no! Look at that!

00:19:17.240 --> 00:19:19.540
You silly boy, Toji!

00:19:24.580 --> 00:19:26.250
You there! Kashiwagi!

00:19:26.250 --> 00:19:27.920
What do you think you're doing?!

00:19:27.920 --> 00:19:30.920
Coming to school on the arm
of another girl's guy?!

00:19:30.920 --> 00:19:31.920
--You don't think

00:19:31.920 --> 00:19:33.260
--you're being nasty to Adachi?!

00:19:33.260 --> 00:19:37.660
Who cares about just his arm?
Besides, we're going together now!

00:19:48.270 --> 00:19:53.610
l missed the whole first period.
l wonder if Toji hasn't heard my message.

00:19:53.610 --> 00:19:55.610
Momo-chan!

00:19:55.610 --> 00:19:57.610
Okayasu!

00:19:57.610 --> 00:20:00.280
Hurry and come with me!
Sae-chan's trying to pull something again!

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:00.950
What?

00:20:00.950 --> 00:20:03.290
She's going around saying that
she and Toji are going together!

00:20:03.290 --> 00:20:05.290
Huh?

00:20:05.290 --> 00:20:07.520
They came to school together arm in arm

00:20:07.520 --> 00:20:08.960
and now the whole school
is buzzing with rumors.

00:20:08.960 --> 00:20:10.020
No!

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:20.970
Adachi! Is it true?!
Did you break up with Toji?!

00:20:20.970 --> 00:20:24.640
No, we didn't break up! That's a lie.

00:20:24.640 --> 00:20:26.870
Toji's not here...

00:20:27.980 --> 00:20:31.180
I'm waiting. Be sure to come.

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:56.010
I found him!

00:20:56.010 --> 00:20:58.680
Momo-chan! Over here! Over here!

00:20:58.680 --> 00:20:59.340
Let me go!

00:20:59.340 --> 00:21:02.280
Right! Just relax.

00:21:02.280 --> 00:21:05.950
If you get away now, Momo-chan will
just chase you till she finds you.

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:07.640
Just face her like a man!

00:21:11.960 --> 00:21:14.960
Tell me, what happened?

00:21:14.960 --> 00:21:18.630
To just suddenly say you want
to break up? I can't accept that.

00:21:18.630 --> 00:21:20.960
You have no reason to say
something like that, Toji.

00:21:20.960 --> 00:21:23.300
Now you see me for what I really am.

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:24.300
That's not true!

00:21:24.300 --> 00:21:28.970
Sae said something to you! Please!
Just tell me what really happened!

00:21:28.970 --> 00:21:31.980
I'll tell you.

00:21:31.980 --> 00:21:35.980
Toji just decided that he likes me
better than you, Momo-chan.

00:21:35.980 --> 00:21:36.980
Right, Toji?

00:21:36.980 --> 00:21:38.650
What are you here for?!

00:21:38.650 --> 00:21:42.320
You being here is just going
to complicate things! Go away!

00:21:42.320 --> 00:21:46.660
Oh! How horrid! Did you hear
what she said to me, Toji?

00:21:46.660 --> 00:21:49.660
It's not true that
you're dating Sae, is it?

00:21:49.660 --> 00:21:53.330
You didn't mean it when you said
you wanted to break up with me, right?

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:54.670
Toji?

00:21:54.670 --> 00:21:58.670
I told you. The whole thing just
suddenly got to be a huge bother.

00:21:58.670 --> 00:22:03.940
I don't believe that!
Please! Tell me the truth!

00:22:03.940 --> 00:22:08.310
Okay. I'll show you. The real reason...

00:22:36.680 --> 00:22:43.020
So much that l can't express it very well...

00:22:43.020 --> 00:22:52.690
so much that l can't believe it...

00:22:52.690 --> 00:22:55.700
l become so uneasy.

00:22:55.700 --> 00:23:02.300
l can't be all alone for so long.

00:23:02.300 --> 00:23:08.640
Where can we go

00:23:08.640 --> 00:23:18.320
where we can all be

00:23:18.320 --> 00:23:21.260
under the same sky?

00:23:21.260 --> 00:23:29.330
l'm sure that there will be stars there.

00:23:29.330 --> 00:23:35.670
No matter how hard things might be,

00:23:35.670 --> 00:23:42.340
there surely, surely is an answer.

00:23:42.340 --> 00:23:49.350
l just wish that l could be

00:23:49.350 --> 00:23:57.310
someone with that kind of courage.

00:24:00.960 --> 00:24:04.300
Toji loves Sae? Does he really mean that?!

00:24:04.300 --> 00:24:07.970
Oh, no! No! l can't live without you, Toji!

00:24:07.970 --> 00:24:10.970
l don't want to break up with him!
l can't break up with him!

00:24:10.970 --> 00:24:14.630
Next time on Peach Girl,
"'The Too-Painful Parting"'
